"The :generator:`FASTBuild` generator gained "
"the :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN` "
"and :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG` variables to use a "
"FASTBuild cache plugin, and the :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_MODE` "
"variable to enable caching in builds started by :option:`cmake --build`."
